{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over &amp; Out!</strong>\u00a0follows the story of two curious 10 year old boys living in a vibrant neighborhood of urban South Asia. It's the middle of the 1990's - before the era of smartphones - and one of the boys finds out he will be moving away in just a week! Determined endure their bond despite the distance, they set out to <strong>build a radio tower\u00a0</strong>powerful enough to stay in touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity and a yearning for adventure, they\u00a0<strong>tinker</strong> with broken toys, <strong>scavenge</strong>\u00a0for parts, help quirky <strong>neighbors</strong>, and <strong>explore</strong> hidden corners of their charming neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016910/extras/918d229b0c39b2fef52ea3610884a140.avif?t=1759212254\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tinker </strong>- Take apart, repair, upgrade and put back together a variety of toys and tools.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016910/extras/17290f8fcc106622442332fd409bdbb0.poster.avif?t=1759212254\" width=768 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016910/extras/17290f8fcc106622442332fd409bdbb0.webm?t=1759212254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Play Minigames </strong>- Beat your opponents in uniquely 90's challenges </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video 